1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,160
In today's video I'm going to take you all along on our cape cod vacation.
今天的视频，我会带大家一起度过我们的科德角假期。

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:07,921
I'm so excited to explore this place that I've heard so many good things about.
我听过很多关于这里的好评，非常期待来探索。

3
00:00:07,921 --> 00:00:10,560
So today was our travel day we flew in.
今天主要是赶路，我们坐飞机过来。

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:14,560
But we did take a very early flight so we were able to pack in some other things today.
不过我们坐的是很早的航班，所以今天还挤出了时间做些别的。

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:17,190
And I will insert all of that right here.
我会把那些画面放在这里。

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,520
All right so we flew into providence rhode island.
我们飞到了罗得岛州的普罗维登斯。

7
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:24,481
And when coming to the cape the two closest major airports are providence and also boston.
来科德角的话，最近的两个主要机场是普罗维登斯和波士顿。

8
00:00:24,481 --> 00:00:29,360
So they're about the same distance driving wise but we chose providence because the flights were cheaper.
两边开车的距离差不多，但我们选普罗维登斯，因为机票更便宜。

9
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:34,001
And you can actually just walk to the rental car facility via a little skywalk at the airport.
而且能走机场的一条小空中连廊，直接到租车中心。

10
00:00:34,001 --> 00:00:37,441
You don't need to take a shuttle or anything so that was really quick and convenient.
不用坐接驳车之类的，所以特别快捷方便。

11
00:00:37,441 --> 00:00:41,441
And then after we got our rental car we just made the hour and a half drive to the cape.
拿到租的车后，我们开了一个半小时到科德角。

12
00:00:41,441 --> 00:00:47,121
Our first stop was anejo which is a gorgeous mexican bistro with two locations on the cape.
第一站是 Anejo，一家很漂亮的墨西哥小餐馆，在科德角有两家店。

13
00:00:47,121 --> 00:00:50,881
And we got there right when they opened and got seated on the outdoor patio.
我们刚好赶上开门，被安排坐在户外露台。

14
00:00:50,881 --> 00:00:55,841
Under this gorgeous weeping beech tree which was planted in 1776.
露台上有棵漂亮的垂枝山毛榉，她说这棵树种于1776年。

15
00:00:55,841 --> 00:01:04,240
So it was amazing how this tree perfectly shaded the entire patio and just made for such a unique relaxing outdoor dining experience.
树荫刚好覆盖整个露台，让户外用餐变得特别而放松。

16
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:10,881
It was so calming to listen to the rustle of the leaves overhead and see all of the twinkle lights strung throughout the branches.
听头顶树叶沙沙响、看枝间串起的小灯，特别平静。

17
00:01:10,881 --> 00:01:16,081
The drinks here were phenomenal I got a spicy margarita and mike got the house margarita.
这里的饮料很棒，我点了辣味玛格丽特，Mike 点了店里的招牌玛格丽特。

18
00:01:16,081 --> 00:01:24,081
They both paired perfectly with our meal and we both got the trace tacos which consisted of carne asada chicken tinga and carnitas.
两杯都很配餐，我们都点了那份含烤牛肉、炖鸡肉和炖猪肉的塔可拼盘。

19
00:01:24,081 --> 00:01:28,321
If you are on the cape and like mexican food this place is a must try.
如果来科德角又喜欢墨西哥菜，作者觉得这里一定值得一试。

20
00:01:28,321 --> 00:01:34,240
Afterwards we walked around the town of hyenas for a little bit and then drove over to see the nabska lighthouse.
之后我们在镇里走了走，再开车去看灯塔。

21
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:40,471
And it was an absolutely gorgeous drive to get there you see so many quaint little homes and even get to drive right along the ocean.
去那里的路漂亮极了，能看到很多别致小房子，还有一段沿海岸开。

22
00:01:40,481 --> 00:01:44,401
So the nobsco lighthouse originated in the year 1828.
她说，这座灯塔始于1828年。

23
00:01:44,401 --> 00:01:48,641
And this is one of the most picturesque lighthouses on the cape in my opinion.
我觉得，这是科德角最上镜的灯塔之一。

24
00:01:48,641 --> 00:01:53,430
There isn't much parking here so try to get here early or maybe on a weekday if you can.
这里停车位不多，所以她建议能的话早点来，或选工作日。

25
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:58,001
Not only can you marvel at the lighthouse but there's also a little trail that goes down to the water.
不仅能欣赏灯塔，还有一条通向水边的小路。

26
00:01:58,001 --> 00:02:03,281
So you can enjoy views of the ocean and you also get to see martha's vineyard off in the distance.
这样可以欣赏海景，还能远眺马萨葡萄园岛。

27
00:02:03,281 --> 00:02:11,440
It was such a gorgeous day with a gentle breeze blowing and it was so charming just to see all of the wildflowers and just to take in the scenery.
那天天气特别好，微风吹着，看看野花、欣赏景色，十分惬意。

28
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:17,271
So next we headed on over to downtown falmouth which was only a 10 minute drive away from the lighthouse.
接着我们来到法尔茅斯市中心，距离灯塔只有十分钟车程。

29
00:02:17,281 --> 00:02:24,241
And here there are dozens of shops and restaurants owned by locals and this area has been protected as a historic district.
这里有很多当地人开的商店和餐馆，这片区域被作为历史街区保护起来。

30
00:02:24,241 --> 00:02:32,720
And we found that this was one of the best places to walk around and shop to find souvenirs locally crafted products and of course more food.
我们觉得这里很适合逛街，找纪念品、本地手作品，当然还有更多吃的。

31
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:40,321
We had to check out the famous local spot called mason velat this is a french bakery that will transport you straight to paris.
我们还去了一家知名本地面包店，作者觉得它让人仿佛直接到了巴黎。

32
00:02:40,321 --> 00:02:46,640
There's usually a line but it moves pretty quickly and is a great spot for a quick breakfast or a grab and go lunch option.
通常要排队，但动得很快，适合快速吃早餐，或买个午餐带走。

33
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:56,961
Overall falmouth main street is such a great spot to just walk around enjoy the curb appeal the flowers everywhere the gentle coastal breeze and just peruse the shops.
总的来说，主街很适合散步、看街景与鲜花、吹海风，再慢慢逛店。

34
00:02:56,961 --> 00:03:02,000
Next we headed on over to check in to our hotel which was the parker beach lodge.
接下来我们去酒店办理入住，住的是 Parker Beach Lodge。

35
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:06,241
All right so real quick this is our hotel room this trip was booked very last minute.
快速给大家看看房间，这趟旅行订得非常临时。

36
00:03:06,241 --> 00:03:09,671
So the only thing they had available was a double queen but.
所以能订到的只剩两张大床的房型，不过……

37
00:03:09,681 --> 00:03:12,481
Seems comfy enough we can cozy up in one of those.
看着够舒服，我们可以挤在其中一张床上。

38
00:03:12,481 --> 00:03:18,790
Oh there's mike outside he was bringing things in from the car but that's the pool.
哦，Mike 在外面，他刚从车里搬东西进来，那边是游泳池。

39
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:25,831
Come on in we have a tv just a really little tiny fridge just somewhere to put like a drink or two.
进来吧，有电视和很小的小冰箱，只够放一两瓶饮料。

40
00:03:25,841 --> 00:03:32,681
Got like a sink an ice bucket a microwave this ac is really cold so that's good.
还有水槽、冰桶、微波炉，空调很凉，这点不错。
